<title>USA: Applied Micro reports higher Q4 sales.</title>
<headline>Applied Micro reports higher Q4 sales.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Micro Circuits Corp. Monday announced sales of $57.5 million for its fiscal year ending March 31, 1997, an increase of 14 percent from the previous fiscal year.</p>
<p>Sales for the fourth quarter were $15.0 million, compared with $12.3 million in the fourth fiscal quarter last year.</p>
<p>Net income in fiscal 1997 was $6.3 million, compared with a loss of $3.7 million in the previous year.</p>
</text>
